# Optional. Copy to .env.local and fill in to make the contact form send messages directly.
# Works with any service that accepts a JSON POST and returns 2xx (e.g. Formspree: https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxx).
# If left empty, the form falls back to opening the visitor's email app with the message pre-filled (mailto).
# This is a PUBLIC endpoint id, not a secret.
VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT=
